Cartoon Pet Workshop

This project includes the OpenAI-bundled hatch-pet Python scripts and two
reference documents under third_party/hatch_pet, copied without modification
from the installed hatch-pet distribution. The upstream LICENSE.txt identifies
Apache License 2.0; that license is preserved alongside the files.

The added scripts and documentation are part of this workshop. Demo character
